    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "속삭임",
        "tooltip": "진이 사용하는 총은 공격 속도가 고정되어 있으며 4발을 발사한 후엔 재장전해야 합니다. 4번째 총탄은 언제나 치명타가 발동되며, <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">대상이 잃은 체력의 (15% ~ 25%)만큼 추가 물리 피해</span>를 입힙니다.<br /><br />추가 효과:<span>진이 <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(4% + (35%) + (30%))의 추가 공격력</span>을 얻습니다.<span>진의 치명타 피해량이 25% 감소하지만, 2초 동안 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가 (14% + (44%))</span> 증가합니다.<br /><br />"
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Whisper",
        "tooltip": "Jhin's hand cannon has a fixed Attack Speed and can be fired 4 times before needing to be reloaded. The 4th shot always critically strikes, and deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15% ~ 25%) missing health physical damage</span>.<br /><br />In addition:<span>Jhin gains <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(4% + (35%) + (30%)) bonus Attack Damage</span><span>Jhin's critical strikes deal 25% less damage but grant him <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(14% + (44%)) Move Speed</span> for 2 seconds.<br /><br />"
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "低语",
        "tooltip": "烬的手枪有着已被固定的攻击速度，并且在发射4次后就得重新装弹。第4颗子弹总会产生暴击并造成相当于目标<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15% ~ 25%)已损失生命值的额外物理伤害</span>。<br /><br />此外：<span>烬获得<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(4% + (35%) + (30%))额外攻击力</span><span>烬的暴击造成的伤害减少25%，但会为他提供<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(14% + (44%))移动速度</span>，持续2秒。<br /><br />"
      }
